---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Credits"
  description="Photography credits, typefaces, and the tools behind alexemm.com."
  lastUpdated={new Date('2026-08-09')}
>

  <p>
    Everything written on this site is mine. Most of the photographs are not, and the
    people who took them deserve their names on the page.
  </p>

  <h2>Photography</h2>

  <!-- Kept on one line deliberately: a marker that grep cannot find is a
       marker that ships by accident. -->
  <p>
    <span class="placeholder">[PLACEHOLDER: photo credits - confirm the photographer for each image before publishing. Draft structure below.]</span>
  </p>

  <div class="legal-table-wrap">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th scope="col">Image</th>
          <th scope="col">Where it appears</th>
          <th scope="col">Photographer</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>Fencing, black and white</td>
          <td>Home, Sport</td>
          <td><span class="placeholder">[PLACEHOLDER]</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Plovdiv, Junior and Cadet World Championship</td>
          <td>Sport gallery</td>
          <td>BizziTeam / @PHOTOPAVIA</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Fencing with my father</td>
          <td>Sport gallery</td>
          <td><span class="placeholder">[PLACEHOLDER]</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Aged seven</td>
          <td>Sport gallery</td>
          <td>Family photograph</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Remaining competition photographs</td>
          <td>Sport gallery</td>
          <td><span class="placeholder">[PLACEHOLDER]</span></td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <p>
    Used with permission. If one of these is yours and you are not credited above, use
    the <a href="/contact">contact form</a> and I will fix it or take it down,
    whichever you prefer.
  </p>

  <h2>Zeton artwork</h2>

  <p>Not my own work. The world is mine. The picture of it is not.</p>

  <h2>Typefaces</h2>

  <p>
    DM Serif Display and DM Sans, both by Colophon Foundry for Google Fonts, released
    under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. Served from this domain, not from Google.
  </p>

  <h2>Built with</h2>

  <p>
    Astro, hosted on Netlify, domain through Porkbun, written in Obsidian, code in a
    terminal.
  </p>

  <h2>Everything else</h2>

  <p>
    Text, structure, code and design: Alexandros Emmanouilidis. Rights reserved. See
    the <a href="/terms">terms</a>.
  </p>

</LegalLayout>
